{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 44, :comments ["<b>Purchased with silver.</b> To include a woman, a slave, and a minor, so that they are like the slave of a man." "<b>And you shall circumcise him, then he may eat of it.</b> To include one in whom the commandment of circumcision has been fulfilled even one hour — even though the flesh went back and covered the corona, it does not prevent him from eating of the Pesach and of terumah. And concerning this our Sages enumerated in Lod and said: it does not interpose for impurity."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:57:28.701371321Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}